{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_panda_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_panda_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"一落千丈","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_panda_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"a72a390848279d63175f5374a2df72b902b234f20aca162fd8f166203f4baeea","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"遭遇了事業危機後，食鐵獸決定振作起來重新開始，可她不知道，萬丈深淵正在不久的將來等待著她。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"食铁兽"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"narration","text":"龍門某高級公寓內"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"答錄通訊機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"答錄通訊機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您有一條語音留言，是否選擇接聽？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（按下播放鍵）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"答錄通訊機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"笙笙哪，你去哪裡了？我到處跑，問了好多人，都說沒見到你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"答錄通訊機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也是被騙了啊，誰想得到小成那傢伙不是個東西，捲了錢就跑啊。這片子亮叔也投了錢的，我也心痛啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"答錄通訊機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"笙笙，亮叔不得不說你一句啦，怎麼能把錢全投在那項目上面呢，再喜歡那個劇本也不行啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"答錄通訊機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，現在好了，電影沒拍成，錢也打了水漂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"答錄通訊機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，先不說了，知道你難過。亮叔在近衛局有認識的人，他們一定會全力偵辦此案，錢肯定能追回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"答錄通訊機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也別太失落，有空了記得給我回個電話啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（按下結束鍵）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"頭疼死了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慘咯，血本無歸啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明就是這老油條介紹來的製片，好嘛，出事了就甩得乾乾淨淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊——氣死老子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乾脆回老家繼承我老爸的糖葫蘆攤算了......唉，這樣老媽又不高興了，她老想著我把家傳的拳法發揚出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（抓頭髮）怎麼辦啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（打開冰箱門）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啤酒......喝完了，威士忌......就一點了，伏特加......早空了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼嘛，都沒了......看來只能下樓去買了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（關上冰箱門）"},{"type":"narration","text":"噹啷——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊好痛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼啊......嘶，是昨天丟在地上的易開罐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好多天都沒出門了，屋裡好亂......要不買完酒回來收拾一下？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘖，算了，再說吧......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，精釀啤酒......來一打，蘭姆酒啊，好久沒喝了，也來一瓶！我再看看......最高一層還有精裝伏特加。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勾不著......跳起來試試？嘿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不好，要掉下來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噔噔咚，鏘鏘鏘，這可難不倒我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這也太、太厲害了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"笙笙小姐，您是笙笙小姐，居然真的是您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我是您的粉絲，您的每一部電影我都有看，您的《天涯俠女》三部曲，每一部我都看了很多遍，能見到您，我、我簡直太、太......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，我不是笙笙小姐，你認錯人了，認錯人了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢？您剛剛接瓶子的姿勢，和《百萬龍門幣》裡的姿勢一模一樣啊！這片我看了七遍，不會看錯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？哈哈，這片子拍完可有好久了......有五六年了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"笙笙小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎呀，總之就是你認錯了，我得去結帳了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"笙笙小姐，我是不是打擾到您了，對不起，我、我不是故意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"真的不好意思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你，我、我不是這個意思，我就是......唉，所以你是想要簽名嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"簽名？！可以嗎？真是太謝謝您了，我找張紙，您等下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這，你能找到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這傢伙快把全身的口袋翻遍了啊......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了，我這有張......鈔票......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"要不......這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，笙笙小姐，就這張鈔票了，拜託您幫我簽個名吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——好吧，沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這鈔票也太皺了吧！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您，謝謝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很喜歡武俠嗎？除了電影，看過小說嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，笙笙小姐，黃先生的大部頭，齊四的小短篇，還有當時的《武俠月刊》，我本本都讀，期期都看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你喜歡齊四小姐？我身邊很多人都說她寫得太拖沓了，看著一點都不爽利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎麼是拖沓呢，齊四小姐文筆細膩，動情處讓人潸然淚下，她的作品都是不可多得的佳作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的真是太——對了，這群榆木腦袋真是一點都不會欣賞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"笙笙小姐，您也喜歡齊四小姐的書？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最最最喜歡《合意拳》了！家裡的那一本都快要被翻爛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這書本來是要改編拍成電影的，可是演小雲生的人因為偷稅進了近衛局，製片又捲了錢跑路，後來不了了之，再沒了下文。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真是可惜，無緣得見！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"世事無常，誰想得到呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......不對。小雲生為人正直，俠肝義膽，寧願粉身碎骨也不願意與權貴同流合污，那樣的演員怎麼能演出他這一身風骨呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"黃了好，黃了才好，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也對，也對，哈哈，這麼想倒也不錯，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙，說得對。那人脾氣又差，演技也不過關，做作得很！和小雲生一點也不搭，知道是他來演，我發了好大一頓脾氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，幸好幸好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，天快暗了，我得趕緊回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我也得走了，笙笙小姐，有緣再見，呃不，應該也沒什麼機會了，謝謝您的簽名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，等等——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"張大姐，納蘭州黃沙滾滾，這一去不復返，何日能再歸，何時能再見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"雲家小子，有家才能歸，有緣方再會，世事難料，珍重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，你果然是真喜歡這個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"第二天"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......頭好痛，宿醉好難受，昨天就不該喝那麼多，嗚......要死要死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"笙笙姐，你這是怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梨花啊，今天有沒有熱的脫脂奶，可以幫我拿一杯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"笙笙姐，我們今天歇業一天，我正打算關門回家呢，恐怕沒法招呼你了，不好意思啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歇業？發生什麼了？我昨天來不還開得好好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，昨天晚上店裡面遭賊了。小偷在逃跑時打翻了好幾個貨架，搞得裡面狼藉一片，剛剛我才打掃完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那小偷抓到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——幸好抓到了，寶仔姐親手抓到的。小偷奮力掙扎時她還受傷了，額角破了好大一塊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，寶仔現在人呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"笙笙姐你別著急啊，寶仔姐在醫院塗了點藥就回去了，沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是了，寶仔她身手一直很不錯，那個小賊遇到她才算是倒大霉了。哎，對了，最近有人找你們打聽過我的消息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"有幾個鬼鬼祟祟的記者來過，問了笙笙姐你最近的去向。我按寶仔姐囑咐的，隨便扯幾句搪塞著打發走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（抓頭）這幾天麻煩你們了，改天一定請你們吃大餐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，當時多虧了笙笙姐你的幫助，我和寶仔姐才能在龍門紮根生活下去，我們為你做這些不算什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我不也老來蹭你們酒喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"這能喝掉幾個錢。噢，對了，笙笙姐，你身上的財物都齊全嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都在......吧，怎麼問起這個了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"那個小偷昨天和你說了一會話，我想著......搞不好那人趁著你不注意會偷拿你的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，怎麼會有人不長眼偷我東西——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你剛剛說誰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，就是你昨天來買酒時，主動上前和你聊天的男人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼！他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"笙笙姐，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......那傢伙現在在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"在、在近衛局的拘留所裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先走了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——改天見！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"哎？笙笙姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"（低頭）我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員A","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"小夥子，既然這位女士願意替你出罰款，出去之後好好做人，這種小偷小摸的事就不要再犯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"阿sir教訓的是，一定不會再犯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員A","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你還是先好好謝謝這位女士吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"......麻煩您了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙，到底為什麼要做這種事啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"（肚子咕嚕作響）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，先出去帶你吃點東西吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿sir，麻煩你啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員A","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"這聲音......好熟悉啊，感覺在哪裡聽過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員B","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙真是呆，那位就是萬小姐啊，你昨天不剛看過人家的《近衛局往事》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員A","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？！你說那位戴墨鏡的女士是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員B","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"對，是你最喜歡的武打女星萬笙笙小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員A","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我到底錯過了什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員B","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，不過這位大明星最近可不好過啊，投資電影失敗，恐怕要傾家蕩產了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員A","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員B","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你都沒看新聞嗎？最近傳得沸沸揚揚，好像是合作方財務出了問題，直接把爛攤子丟給萬小姐，自己跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員A","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"不要啊，笙笙小姐一定很難過的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_park"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二位的大份鱗丸好了，加了蘿蔔與粉麵，請享用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆你真的是好手藝，我就是吃一萬次也不會膩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你都是大明星了，還總來吃小攤，不怕被狗仔拍到笑你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼好怕的，被拍到就當給你做廣告囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別別，我可付不起廣告費。哎，靚仔，你怎麼光看不吃啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃就是了，拘謹什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝笙笙小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們先聊，我去看看爐子上煮著的咖哩湯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"原來這就是鱗丸，來龍門後我還是第一次吃，真的好吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊我經常來的，據說老闆是龍門大幫派的頭目，後來金盆洗手擺攤來做鱗丸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"噗——咳咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看過來）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻，騙你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咕咚，沒事沒事，笙笙小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你還沒有回答我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要去店裡做那樣的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我......兩天沒吃飯，餓昏頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好哇，餓昏頭偷東西也就算了，為什麼還要傷人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆娘逮到我時，看到我手裡攥著張鈔票，想讓我把錢付了，不然不放我走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後你不想付帳，所以打傷了老闆娘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"......笙笙小姐，那張鈔票，是我身上最後一張了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也不至於為了這個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你說的是那張啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，本來昨天進店是打算拿它買些吃的，但是遇到了你，你還在上面簽了名，我實在是不想花出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在......有地方去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒有，上周剛剛被房東趕出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來怎麼辦，想回老家嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"父母走得早，老家也沒什麼親人在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊還有朋友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"才來龍門兩個月，哪有什麼認識的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"笙笙小姐，我沒啥本事......討生活，也不容易。能見到你，我真的很開心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，別這麼想，總會好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"（抹眼淚）笙笙小姐，我不好，給你添麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那之後......你打算怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，只要有一口飯吃，日子總能往下過吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，你有筆嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，有，在小抽屜裡，你自己拿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看啊，找到了，再扯你一張紙行不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿就是了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（提筆寫字）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"笙笙小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，這是我認識的一位場務負責人，你去找他給你安排些打雜跑腿的活，他那賺得不多，好在包吃住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你......笙笙小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，再來兩份鱗丸，一份打包帶走，一份還在這裡吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以後的日子好好過，埋頭向前走，過去的日子就甩得遠遠的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鱗丸一份，打包好了，您拿好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一份你帶去吧，不是白請你的，以後賺了錢，可要請回來啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚......笙笙小姐，真的不好意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，快去片場吧，不然一會他們下班了你找不到人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，笙笙小姐，我走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"笙笙小姐，我會努力做事，踏實做人的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好，我知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歎什麼氣，怎麼，我的鱗丸不夠味啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，我也好難啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底發生什麼了，亮叔昨天來找過我，說你一周沒接他的電話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得我和你說過的那個本子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"齊四的《合意拳》？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，賠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全部家當。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不至於吧，就一分一毫也沒剩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是剩了些積蓄，不過那部分是固定打給慈善基金組織的錢，不能動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你之後打算怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是幸運的話，說不定能抓到人，把錢追回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就只能重頭再來了。我還有一身好功夫，總有片子拍的，餓不著啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你本來計畫好的那些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有什麼計畫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人嘛，越不清醒越喜歡長慮後顧，要嘛在半夜裡想明天，要嘛在醉話裡說未來，睡醒來酒醒後就回過味了，想得少才能活得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總會碰上轉機的，將來肯定會好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用安慰我啦，我很堅強的。只要明天還能吃到你的鱗丸，我的日子就能往下過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼還豎上大拇指了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，再說，過日子哪能光靠轉機呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有時候遇上件小小的開心事，就短短那一會兒，哪怕什麼也改變不了，我就能靠這點快活再把日子往下過幾天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你最近遇上什麼開心事了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有啊，我剛剛吃了你的鱗丸啊，舌頭都香掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，還有別的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我想想，對了，有個導演聯繫我了，片酬給得蠻高，我打算明天去試鏡看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那我也來請你吃一碗鱗丸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（端上桌一碗鱗丸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，新做法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想試試製作香辣口味的鱗丸，不知道有沒有市場，正好拜託你來試試口味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吃耶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊舌頭燒起來了，連我都覺得好辣啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊有冰水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬笙笙","speakerId":"avg_241_panda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊才不喝，嘶哈嘶哈，這可是好兆頭，不可以澆涼水......嘶哈，我的事業一定會紅紅火火，再創輝煌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩周後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員B","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"小賈，早啊，喏，給你帶了杯咖啡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員A","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝堯哥，麻煩了。今天怎麼樣，忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員B","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"事情多得很！哎，你把報紙翻來翻去的找什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員A","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我在找娛樂版。堯哥，說來也奇怪，最近看報都沒看到笙笙小姐的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員B","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道嗎？幾天前笙笙小姐在片場受傷了，被送入急診室了，也不知道傷情如何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員A","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"可要是皮外傷應該很快就出院了，怎麼這麼久還不見報導啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員B","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"明星嘛，出了事肯定低調，說不定這時候已經回家了，你就別擔心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員A","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我還是心裡很忐忑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員B","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，大老爺們這麼敏感啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員A","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，早上出門，我看見笙笙小姐的廣告都被撤下了，一張都沒剩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員B","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，怪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局成員A","近衛局成員B"]}]}
